I build websites for window and door installers around {City}. {Business Name} has good install work on its social pages, but no site a homeowner finds when they search for window replacement.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a window style guide by room, frame materials compared, glass and energy labels in plain words, an entry door gallery and a measure request, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

